     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "A. Soroka",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "2011-11-16T16:44:42.872-0400"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Yes we would certainly need a mechanism for querying the full RI graph as-a-whole, and Mulgara views are a route for doing that.  Some while ago I did some performance testing on this - single graph vs view over a number of graphs and the numbers were not good.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "One could potentially use the SPARQL route of querying GRAPH ?g { ?s ?p ?o }  - I haven't tested that.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "My view is that the Fedora RI should stay as it is (or even in the future be moved out of Fedora).  Although being able to handle things described in this ticket would certainly be of value there's a whole host of other things that could also be of value in a semweb context.  Consider entailment, and managing that, or other forms of reasoning.  Or entity recognition from full-text and adding that to the RI.  There's a point where we'd be in danger of developing something where a solution already exists, and my view is that the effort would be better spent on integration with tools built for the job.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
