    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "A. Soroka",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I really wish we had some kind of actual data on who uses the RI and to what level of sophistication. The inability to use subjects other than Fedora objects and datastreams has been a hindrance to me in the past, but I have no way of knowing if that is a common experience or very rare. It seems to me that to make a good decision about this present issue (as well as \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-652\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-652\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Restructure resource index as a set of named graphs\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-652\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n) we need to know something about people are actually using the RI and how they want to, but I confess, I don't know how to learn that.</p>",
     "created": "16/Nov/11 5:54 PM",
     "id": "12121",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10612/comment/12121",
